---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "@/components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "@/components/Footer.astro";
import Prose from "@/components/Prose.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About the Studio - Elite Engineering & Autonomous Systems"
  description="NextReach Studio is a Pune software engineering studio building bespoke websites, scalable platforms, and autonomous AI systems with venture-grade velocity."
>
  <Nav />
  <main class="container-page relative">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/4 -translate-y-12 w-[400px] h-[250px] bg-[#C76B50]/6 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none -z-10" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <header class="header-page animate-fade-in-up">
      <p class="header-page-pretitle font-mono text-[#C76B50] uppercase tracking-widest text-xs font-bold">About NextReach Studio</p>
      <h1 class="header-page-title font-display text-[#1F1F23] text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight">Architectural rigor. Venture velocity.</h1>
      <p class="header-page-subtitle text-[#6E6862] text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-2xl font-body">
        We build high-converting custom websites, scalable cloud platforms, and autonomous AI systems for ambitious founders and modern enterprises.
      </p>
    </header>

    <Prose>
      <h2>Our Mandate</h2>
      <p>
        NextReach Studio was founded in Pune, India, with a singular, uncompromising conviction: to bring elite, enterprise-grade software engineering to ambitious businesses without the bureaucracy, inflated retainers, and junior-developer handoffs typical of legacy agencies.
      </p>
      <p>
        We operate as a principal-led engineering studio. When you contract us, you collaborate directly with the senior software engineers architecting your database, designing your user experience, and deploying your cloud infrastructure. We engineer high-velocity website launch packages for local Indian enterprises, alongside mission-critical full-stack applications and autonomous AI pipelines for international tech founders.
      </p>

      <h2>The NextReach Studio Engineering Model</h2>
      <p>We reject the traditional agency model in favor of mathematical transparency:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Fixed-Scope Investment Clarity:</strong> We don't believe in open-ended hourly billing that rewards inefficiency. Every engagement is executed under a transparent, fixed-scope contract with guaranteed delivery milestones.</li>
        <li><strong>Direct Principal Architect Access:</strong> Zero account managers, zero sales relays. Technical discussions happen directly with the engineers building your software, guaranteeing rapid decision velocity.</li>
        <li><strong>First-Principles Architecture:</strong> We prioritize real business impact: sub-second latency, accessible and responsive interfaces, secure databases, and clean, modular codebases built on modern stacks (TypeScript, Next.js, Astro, Python, Rust, PostgreSQL).</li>
        <li><strong>100% Intellectual Property Handover:</strong> You own all source code, repository histories, design vectors, and cloud infrastructure configurations. No vendor lock-in. Ever.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>NextReach Labs: Proven Technical Depth</h2>
      <p>
        We believe engineering credibility is demonstrated through open proof of work. Through <strong>NextReach Labs</strong>, our open-access R&amp;D initiative, we develop and maintain public developer intelligence tools and AI engineering benchmarks.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our tools - including the AI Token Calculator, LLM Cost Calculator, and VRAM Estimator - along with our in-depth architectural guides on Claude Code, Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers, and context window orchestration, are actively used by AI engineers across the globe. We apply this exact standard of precision to every client project.
      </p>

      <h2>Global Standards, Pune Heritage</h2>
      <p>
        We are based in Pune, Maharashtra - one of India's premier engineering and technology capitals - and work as a remote-first studio across Pune, Pimpri-Chinchwad, and the wider region. NextReach Studio is an independent studio operating exclusively at nextreachstudio.in, and is not affiliated with any other company using the name NextReach. We serve local enterprises seeking digital flagships, while maintaining an active portfolio of remote engagements across North America, Europe, and Southeast Asia.
      </p>

      <h2>Start an Engagement</h2>
      <p>
        Whether you require a high-converting website launched in 24-72 hours or a complex autonomous AI workflow, review our <a href="/#packages">launch packages</a>, explore our <a href="/portfolio/">case studies</a>, or <a href="/contact/">initiate a direct technical consultation</a>.
      </p>
    </Prose>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
